  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "mpmX AI-Powered Camunda Process Orchestration",
    "splashDescription": "mpmX AI enables Camunda users to easily optimize end-to-end business processes. It gives business users the power to analyze and optimize processes in a chat-style interface where they can ask questions. By connecting the mpmX process intelligence engine with Camunda and any choice of external or internal LLM, users can pinpoint process issues and correct them using prompts. This significantly reduces the technical threshold required to carry out significant and meaningful process optimization.",
